## Common Patterns
- **Widget extraction**: Break large widgets into smaller, focused components
- **Provider optimization**: Use selectors and listeners appropriately
- **Error handling**: Global error handler with user-friendly messages
- **Responsive design**: Single Responsive.builder per route subtree
- **Testing**: Unit, widget, and integration tests for all features

## File Organization
- **Domain**: Pure business logic, entities, use cases
- **Data**: Repository implementations, models, data sources
- **Presentation**: UI widgets, pages, view models
- **Core**: Shared utilities, responsive system, error handling
- **Shared**: Reusable widgets and services

## Performance Guidelines
- **Lists**: Use ListView.builder with itemExtent/prototypeItem
- **Images**: Cache with appropriate sizes, use WebP when possible
- **Animations**: Smooth 60fps, use RepaintBoundary for heavy widgets
- **State**: Minimize rebuilds with granular subscriptions
- **Memory**: Proper disposal of controllers and animations

## Security Considerations
- **No hardcoded secrets**: Use environment variables
- **Input validation**: Sanitize all user inputs
- **Secure storage**: Use Flutter secure storage for sensitive data
- **Data encryption**: Encrypt sensitive data in local storage

## Testing Strategy
- **Unit tests**: Business logic, use cases, repositories
- **Widget tests**: UI components, user interactions
- **Integration tests**: Complete user flows
- **Golden tests**: Visual regression testing
- **Performance tests**: FPS, memory usage, startup time

## Documentation Standards
- **Code comments**: Explain complex logic and business rules
- **API documentation**: Document public interfaces
- **README updates**: Keep project documentation current
- **Changelog**: Track changes and new features

## Commit Conventions
- **feat**: New features
- **fix**: Bug fixes
- **perf**: Performance improvements
- **refactor**: Code refactoring
- **test**: Test additions or updates
- **chore**: Maintenance tasks
- **docs**: Documentation updates
